 and a magic lamp on magic carpets","illustrator":"Jaikar Marur","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":7,"title":"A train carrying a huge rock","illustrator":"Jaikar Marur","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":8,"title":"Big sea turtle carrying a small pebble","illustrator":"Jaikar Marur","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":9,"title":"crows chasing truck on mountains","illustrator":"Jaikar Marur","holder":"Jaikar Marur","year":"2019"},{"page":10,"title":"Boy sees a pebble in the library","illustrator":"Jaikar Marur","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":11,"title":"Boy imagining a fun world","illustrator":"Jaikar Marur","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":12,"title":"Boy finds a feather in his shoe","illustrator":"Jaikar Marur","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":13,"title":"A rabbit jumping across","illustrator":"Jaikar Marur","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/59998-bootallondu-benachukallu/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/59998-bootallondu-benachukallu/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಖಾಲಿ ಬೂಟಲ್ಲಿ ಈಗೊಂದು ಬೆಣಚುಕಲ್ಲು,","ಪಕ್ಕದ ಬೀದಿಗೆ ಕೇಳಲು ಹೋಗಿದ್ದೆ ಢಂಗುರದ ಸದ್ದು,","ಆಗಲೇ ಸೇರಿತೇನೋ ದಿಬಿ ದಿಬಿ ಇದು?"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/59998-bootallondu-benachukallu/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಇಲ್ಲ, ಆಕಾಶದಿಂದ ಏನಾದರೂ ಬಿತ್ತಾ?","ಯಾವುದೋ ಮೋಡವೋ, ಹಕ್ಕಿನೋ…","ದೊಡ್ಡ ಕಣ್ಣು, ಡುಮ್ಮ ಹೊಟ್ಟೆಯ ಗುಮ್ಮ","ಏನಾದರೂ ಎಸೆದನೇ?"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/59998-bootallondu-benachukallu/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಖಾಲಿ ಬೂಟಲ್ಲಿ ಬೆಣಚುಕಲ್ಲು,","ಅದೇನು, ಆ ಪಾರ್ಕ್ ನಿಂದ ಬಂತೇ?","ಹಾಂ, ನನ್ನ ಗೆಳೆಯ ವಂಡರಗಪ್ಪೆಯೇ ಹಾಕಿತೇನೋ?","ಟರ್! ಟರ್! ಟರ್!"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/59998-bootallondu-benachukallu/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅಥವಾ ಹಾರು ಜಮಖಾನೆಯಿಂದ ಇಳಿಯಿತೇ?","ಅದೇ ನಾನು ಎಂದೋ ಕೇಳಿದ್ದ ಕತೆಯಿಂದ."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/59998-bootallondu-benachukallu/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಚುಕುಬುಕು ರೈಲಲ್ಲಿ ಬಂತೇ?","ಅದೇ ದೂರದ ಲಾಹೋರಿನಿಂದ…","ನನ್ನ ಖಾಲಿ ಬೂಟಲ್ಲಿ ಬೆಣಚುಕಲ್ಲು."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/59998-bootallondu-benachukallu/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಅಥವಾ ಈಜುತ್ತಾ ಬಂತೇ?","ಸಮುದ್ರ ರಾಕ್ಷಸನ ಜತೆಗೆ…"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/59998-bootallondu-benachukallu/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಖಾಲಿ ಬೂಟಲ್ಲಿ ಬೆಣಚುಕಲ್ಲು.","ಮೀನು ಲಾರಿ ಏರಿ ಇಲ್ಲಿಗೆ ಬಂತೇ?","ಹಸಿದ ಕಾ! ಕಾ! ಕಾ! ಕಾಗೆಗಳ ಕಣ್ಣು ತಪ್ಪಿಸಿ."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/59998-bootallondu-benachukallu/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಲೈಬ್ರರಿಯಿಂದ ಬಂತೆ?","ನಾನು ಪುಸ್ತಕ ತರಲು ಹೋದಾಗ?"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/59998-bootallondu-benachukallu/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಖಾಲಿ ಬೂಟಲ್ಲಿ ಬೆಣಚುಕಲ್ಲು.","ನೆನ್ನೆವರೆಗೂ ಇರಲಿಲ್ಲ ಅದರಲ್ಲೇನೂ… ಅರೆ!","ಇದು ಎಲ್ಲಿಂದ ಬಂದಿರಬಹುದು?","ಇನ್ನೂ ಗೊತ್ತಾಗಬೇಕಷ್ಟೆ."]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/59998-bootallondu-benachukallu/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅರೆ! ನನ್ನ ಬೂಟಲ್ಲೊಂದು ಹಕ್ಕಿಯ ಪುಕ್ಕ!"]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/59998-bootallondu-benachukallu/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]}],"wordCount":112}